# Routing & Auth

## Route guards (compose, don't duplicate logic)

| Guard | Checks | Redirect |
|-------|--------|----------|
| `RequireAuth` | valid token + `useMe` success | `/login` |
| `RequireFreelancer` | role owner/member + workspace context | `/login` |
| `RequireClient` | role client + client context | `/login` |
| `RequireSuperAdmin` | `role: super_admin` | `/app` |

## Post-login routing (`PersonaRedirect`)

```
super_admin  → /admin
client       → /portal
freelancer   → /app
```

## Layout nesting

```
AuthLayout     → public auth pages (no sidebar)
AppLayout      → /app/* (WorkspaceSwitcher, ReadOnlyBanner)
PortalLayout   → /portal/* (ClientSwitcher, read-only)
AdminLayout    → /admin/* (no workspace header)
```

## Read-only mode

When `subscription.read_only === true`:
- Disable all tenant **write** mutations in UI
- API returns 403 `workspace_read_only` — show toast if user tries
- Subscription routes remain writable (owner checkout/cancel)

## Route files stay thin

```tsx
// ✅ routes only import pages
{ path: 'clients', element: <ClientsPage /> }

// ❌ no data fetching or business logic in routes
```
